# Bharat Bazaar Intelligence Platform

## Project Summary
Bharat Bazaar Intelligence Platform is an end-to-end Data Analytics project developed using Python, SQL, Machine Learning, and Power BI. The project analyzes global e-commerce sales data to uncover business insights and predict future sales trends.

## Objectives
- Clean and preprocess raw sales data.
- Perform SQL-based business analysis.
- Explore sales patterns using EDA.
- Build a Machine Learning model for sales prediction.
- Create an interactive Power BI dashboard.

## Tools & Technologies
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- SQL (SQLite)
- Scikit-learn
- Power BI
- Jupyter Notebook
- Git & GitHub

## Project Workflow
1. Data Understanding
2. Data Cleaning
3. SQL Analysis
4. Exploratory Data Analysis
5. Feature Engineering
6. Machine Learning
7. Interactive Dashboard
8. Business Insights & Recommendations

## Conclusion
This project demonstrates the complete data analytics lifecycle and provides actionable business insights through visualization and predictive analytics.